      "instruction": "Suddenly his body tenses... then he falls to the floor.",
      "narrativeImage": "Korban Jatuh",
      "options": []
    },
    {
      "stepType": "minigame",
      "instruction": "The electricity has been turned off. It is now safe to approach the victim.",
